{"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"1718867188","y":0.046511627815394085,"w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"x":0.7716049391467531},{"y":0.097383721316210314,"w":0.3374485524495443,"h":0.018929588219021354,"x":0.10082304877458886,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","c":1},{"x":0.10082305614265726,"c":1,"y":0.13221436958310706,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.","h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.65020573933919268},{"w":0.74279836018880208,"h":0.017469252798666846,"c":1,"x":0.10082304202334304,"y":0.15694935200652593,"t":"Mobile phones, nowadays, contains essential features with entertainment also. There has been a"},{"x":0.098765442893398003,"w":0.74691355387369796,"y":0.17579505336817192,"h":0.01897238786425548,"t":"large growth seen in usage hours of smartphones among youngsters. There are several reasons","c":1},{"h":0.019462347311462569,"c":1,"y":0.19463882067156768,"x":0.098704122361405008,"t":"behind this situation and I find this development more beneficial than negative. Both the reasons","w":0.76143803914388031},{"h":0.017510340547954861,"w":0.27160494486490883,"x":0.10082304184992646,"t":"and my view is elaborated further.","c":1,"y":0.21511627890403839},{"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1,"t":"The first reason for overusage of smart devices by youngsters is the social benefit they provide.","x":0.098765427912866618,"w":0.74897120157877606,"y":0.24116607773605936},{"x":0.098765423241257699,"w":0.77983540852864586,"h":0.018977524675385049,"t":"The smart phone connected with internet opens up the large possibilities, from creating new friends","y":0.26017441899301075,"c":1},{"x":0.098765444323598031,"y":0.27906976728016708,"t":"to communicating with them over social media. For instance, a child in my neighbourhood chats","w":0.75308639526367194,"h":0.017455556507807057,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"for hours with his school friends over Facebook (a social media) and also spend time over online","h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.7633744812011718,"y":0.29796511611771725,"x":0.098765434220869863},{"w":0.732510274251302,"c":1,"t":"video sharing phone application. Moreover, the mobile gaming, specially multiplayer games, is","h":0.017441860778592999,"x":0.10082305205548854,"y":0.31831395332867751},{"c":1,"y":0.33568904572131919,"w":0.76954732259114578,"h":0.018962116488579261,"t":"another major reason for the situation. Children plays different kind of games over mobile for the","x":0.10082304977438582},{"h":0.018992932862190837,"y":0.35600706674215377,"t":"entertainment purpose and they involve themselves in games in such a manner, that they forget","c":1,"x":0.10082304927895061,"w":0.75102879842122394},{"h":0.01973605970331016,"x":0.10068439256161753,"t":"about the timing and other work to do.","y":0.37485842945333636,"c":1,"w":0.31093643188476561},{"w":0.76131688435872391,"c":1,"h":0.019140164899882239,"x":0.10082303916642028,"y":0.40106007058962267,"t":"However, I believe that smartphones have also increased the knowledge of pupils. It has developed"},{"x":0.10082306926018343,"y":0.42005813969053762,"c":1,"h":0.018987797174352727,"w":0.76131683349609369,"t":"some important social skills, such as communication skill, team work and many more, by allowing"},{"x":0.098765441217970346,"y":0.43895348852774696,"w":0.73251027425130211,"h":0.018938148822043033,"c":1,"t":"them to work and play in groups, without the restriction of distance. In addition, children can"},{"t":"learn through internet by watchin online videos and reading articles, which ultimately helps them","c":1,"h":0.018907332448431458,"w":0.75925923665364581,"x":0.098765443310085368,"y":0.45930232597016363},{"t":"in their studies as well as language skills. For example, whenever my niece require to know about","c":1,"y":0.47819767480742237,"x":0.098765434203874819,"w":0.76337448120117191,"h":0.018895348053517669},{"c":1,"y":0.4985276794897453,"w":0.77983540852864586,"t":"something, he searches it over the internet and learns from it. Moreover, multiplayer online gaming","x":0.10082303636678555,"h":0.017460692757290897},{"t":"improves their multitasking ability and it also gives them a competitive environment","c":1,"y":0.51737338053376258,"h":0.01751034054795475,"x":0.10082305516258713,"w":0.65637858072916666},{"t":"Overall, I agree that overusage of smartphones on regular basis is harmful for them, but if given","h":0.018919316843345135,"y":0.54358068276207061,"x":0.10082305646085521,"c":1,"w":0.75925923665364581},{"y":0.56242638436930958,"c":1,"x":0.10082305082806874,"t":"proper guidance, mobile phones can help them in learning some life-long skills.","w":0.62962961832682296,"h":0.018968964072363481},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.86773255795657411,"t":"131","x":0.84773662574797204,"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146502},{"x":0.66991094639740412,"y":0.95311055968589831,"w":0.30613845825195307,"h":0.033792529426278195,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"w":2400}